# @name: redis | Set Multiple Hash Fields
# @description: Sets multiple fields in a hash Group: Redis Hash Operations. Template: replace placeholders before running. {key} = Hash key name | {field1} = First field name | {value1} = First field value | {field2} = Second field name | {value2} = Second field value
HMSET {key} {field1} {value1} {field2} {value2}